  "description": "Two identical stages (two parties and their pigeonhole racks). In both, the promise token (●) and the performance token (◆) cross between the parties at the same moments and a plain line then joins them, captioned \"Linked as supplied\" (no arrowhead). The one changed fact is the supplied status of the performance: in A «Performance identified»; in B «Question to be analysed», where the performance token and the link carry the dashed pending marker — an open question, not a failure. A comparison table lists every event; the link's row carries each status and a Δ guide outlines it. The concept label \"consideration\" is shown as supplied and illustrative. No winner, no rule about the concept, no legal effect.",
